# Neovim configuration

## Dependencies
 - ripgrep                 - Used in mini.pick
 - fd                      - Used in mini.pick
 - git                     - Used in mini.pick
 - wget                    - Downloads spell dictionaries
 - ctags                   - Tag navigation
 - gopls                   - Go LSP
 - sqls                    - SQL LSP
 - git-bash(windows only)  - Shell replacement for windows
 - clang-format???         - C files automatic format

